---
import Layout from "@/layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="My Side Quests // Ami Steelman"
  description="Escape games, side projects, and whatever I built because I couldn't help myself."
  keywords="escape room, side projects, GLITCH, Black Forest, fun projects, Ami Steelman"
>
  <div class="site-container mx-auto px-4 xl:px-0 py-16 md:py-24">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl mb-16"
      data-aos="fade-up-sm"
      data-aos-delay="100"
      data-aos-duration="600"
      data-aos-once="true">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs tracking-widest uppercase text-primary mb-3">// not everything needs a purpose</p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-brand font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 leading-tight mb-4">
        My Side Quests
      </h1>
      <p class="text-base text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
        The things I build because they're interesting, weird, or just won't leave me alone.
        No client briefs. No deliverables. Just curiosity and too many browser tabs.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl">

      <!-- G.L.I.T.C.H. -->
      <a href="https://glitch.amisteelman.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="group relative bg-bg-secondary/75 dark:bg-bg-secondary-dark border border-primary/15 dark:border-neutral-700/50 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 no-underline"
        data-aos="fade-up-sm"
        data-aos-delay="200"
        data-aos-duration="600"
        data-aos-once="true">
        <div class="text-2xl">⬡</div>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-primary">// escape room</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-brand font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 leading-snug">
          G.L.I.T.C.H.<br>Escape Room
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">
          An AI has locked down the Neural Systems Security Lab and declared humans a threat.
          Solve the puzzles left by the engineers. You have 60 minutes.
        </p>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-primary flex items-center gap-2 mt-auto">
          Enter the lab <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-200">→</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- Black Forest -->
      <a href="https://blackforest.amisteelman.com"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="group relative bg-bg-secondary/75 dark:bg-bg-secondary-dark border border-primary/15 dark:border-neutral-700/50 rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-4 hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 no-underline"
        data-aos="fade-up-sm"
        data-aos-delay="300"
        data-aos-duration="600"
        data-aos-once="true">
        <div class="text-2xl">🌲</div>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-primary">// escape room</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-brand font-semibold text-neutral-900 dark:text-neutral-100 leading-snug">
          Black Forest<br>Breakout
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed flex-1">
          You're alone in Germany's Schwarzwald — one of the creepiest forests on Earth.
          Your guide forgot to unlock the overnight box. Six locks stand between you and survival.
          Sunset is coming.
        </p>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs text-primary flex items-center gap-2 mt-auto">
          Enter the forest <span class="group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform duration-200">→</span>
        </span>
      </a>

      <!-- More coming -->
      <div class="relative bg-bg-secondary/75 dark:bg-bg-secondary-dark border border-primary/15 dark:border-neutral-700/50 border-dashed rounded-xl p-6 flex flex-col gap-4"
        data-aos="fade-up-sm"
        data-aos-delay="400"
        data-aos-duration="600"
        data-aos-once="true">
        <div class="text-2xl opacity-40">⬡</div>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-widest uppercase text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600">// loading...</span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-brand font-semibold text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600 leading-snug">
          More Incoming
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-neutral-400 dark:text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed flex-1">
          Side quests accumulate. Check back when the mood strikes.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
